      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Membership changes break the simple time-shift shortcut.\n\nTwenty-four students average 35 years—imagine an adult class. A teacher joins and the 25-person average becomes 35.4.",
